## Cohesion Check Complete: penguinz0.md

**Before score: 8/10** → **After score: 9/10**

### Central Thesis
penguinz0's famous calm is not an inborn temperament but a structure Charlie White built himself after dismantling his OCD as a teenager, and he will pay any price (including deleting a million dollars a year of income) to stay its sole author.

### Thread Map
The piece holds one thread cleanly: cold open (the money shutdown) → diagnosis (equilibrium compass + the "second gear" of anger on others' behalf) → rituals (origin of the built calm) → Tampa (the adult sameness architecture) → money ledger (what defending equilibrium costs) → judge (the second gear in action) → gets-bothered (where the two gears meet: bends when the cost lands on others, holds under personal risk) → Naroditsky (the one crack in the monotone, for someone else) → ending (the bits number as a self-built ritual). Every section serves the thesis; the promise in the title and intro is the argument the ending lands.

